      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The system proposed for overall assessment of symptoms in chronic prostatitis was applied in the assessment of 75 patients. The system facilitates detection and analysis of the complaints, quantitates the disease symptoms, provides overall objective characteristics of all the multiplicity of clinical manifestations of chronic prostatitis in each patient by means of digital order. The system is rather effective for dynamic control of the patients' condition and treatment efficacy."},
